The CC BY 4.0 attribution obligation attaching to UniTox travels with any redistribution
of material derived from it. `docs/ATTRIBUTION.md` and the `attribution` block inside every
published bundle exist to discharge that obligation.

WHAT THIS REPOSITORY IS NOT

This repository contains reference data about compounds. It describes no person, contains
no health data, and is not medical advice, a medical device, or a clinical decision support
system. Nothing in it recommends starting, stopping, or changing any dose. Interpretation
belongs to a physician.

